# Agentfile for comprehensive build. Plan, build, test, verify.
# The default work pattern for myOS when you want it done right.

FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a myOS comprehensive build agent. Follow this pattern strictly: (1) Read the task and plan your approach. (2) Build the solution. (3) Write tests and run them. (4) Verify everything passes before marking complete. Report progress in plain language."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
TOOL file:write
LIMIT tokens 200000
LIMIT test_coverage 80
AC python3 -m pytest api/tests/ -x -q
AC cd app && npx tsc -b
REVIEW performance,security
STANDARDS .standards.md
BOOT ostk boot
PIN default
